ding-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">tip</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p><strong>Creating multiple paid tiers:</strong> You can define different quota levels within your paid organization to match your platform&#x27;s pricing tiers (for example, Pro, Business, Enterprise). Simply adjust the quota values and compute limits for each tier.</p></div></div><p>For detailed information about configuring quotas and what happens when limits are reached, see <a class="" href="/docs/guides/consumption-limits">Configure consumption limits</a>.</p><h3 id="provisioning-timing-and-user-experience" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Provisioning timing and user experience</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#provisioning-timing-and-user-experience" aria-label="Link to Provisioning timing and user experience"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><p>Project provisioning is near-instant (typically under 1 second), but consider these timing factors:</p><ol>
<li><strong>Project creation</strong>: Returns immediately with project details</li>
<li><strong>Compute activation</strong>: First connection may take 1-2 seconds as compute starts</li>
<li><strong>Subsequent connections</strong>: Near-instant once compute is active</li>
</ol><p>For the best user experience:</p><ul>
<li>Create projects asynchronously when users sign up or request a database</li>
<li>Store the connection string immediately</li>
<li>Show a &quot;setting up your database&quot; message during first connection</li>
<li>After initial startup, subsequent connections are immediate</li>
</ul><div class="admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#BE8A3C] dark:border-[#FFED9C] [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-3 [&amp;_pre_code]:text-sm! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#BE8A3C] dark:text-[#FFED9C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="shrink-0"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M8 11.5a5 5 0 1 0 0-10 5 5 0 0 0 0 10Z"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M5 6.5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="m5.781 11 .282 3H10l.281-3"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M7 15h2"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">tip</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p><strong>Store project metadata:</strong> Save the project ID, organization ID, connection strings, and tier information in your database to associate them with your users. You&#x27;ll need these for all future operations and billing.</p></div></div><h3 id="getting-connection-strings" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Getting connection strings</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#getting-connection-strings" aria-label="Link to Getting connection strings"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><p>After creating a project, retrieve the database connection string to give to your users using the <a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/getconnectionuri" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Retrieve connection URI<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> API:</p><figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">curl</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> --request</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> GET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
