match the user&#x27;s new tier using the <a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/updateproject" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Update project<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> API:</p><figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">curl</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> --request</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> PATCH</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --url</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> https://console.neon.tech/api/v2/projects/{project_id}</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --header</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;Accept: application/json&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --header</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &quot;Authorization: Bearer $PAID_ORG_API_KEY&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --header</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;Content-Type: application/json&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --data</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;{</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">  &quot;project&quot;: {</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="8"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;settings&quot;: {</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="9"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">      &quot;quota&quot;: {</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="10"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">        &quot;active_time_seconds&quot;: 720000,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="11"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">        &quot;compute_time_seconds&quot;: 2880000</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="12"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">      }</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="13"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    },</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="14"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;default_endpoint_settings&quot;: {</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="15"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">      &quot;autoscaling_limit_max_cu&quot;: 4</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="16"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    }</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="17"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">  }</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="18"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">}&#x27;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure><div class="admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#BE8A3C] dark:border-[#FFED9C] [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-3 [&amp;_pre_code]:text-sm! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#BE8A3C] dark:text-[#FFED9C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="shrink-0"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M8 11.5a5 5 0 1 0 0-10 5 5 0 0 0 0 10Z"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M5 6.5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="m5.781 11 .282 3H10l.281-3"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M7 15h2"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">tip</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p><strong>Transfer limits:</strong> You can transfer up to 400 projects per API request. To create a personal API key, see <a class="" href="/docs/manage/api-keys#create-a-personal-api-key">Create a personal API key</a>.</p></div></div><p>For more details, see <a class="" href="/docs/manage/orgs-project-transfer">Transfer projects between organizations</a>.</p><h3 id="handling-downgrades" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Handling downgrades</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#handling-downgrades" aria-label="Link to Handling downgrades"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><p>When a paid user downgrades to your free tier, transfer their project from the paid organization to the Free organization (sponsored) using the same personal API key:</p><figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Transfer to Free organization (sponsored)</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">curl</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> --request</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> PATCH</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --url</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> https://console.neon.tech/api/v2/projects/{project_id}/transfer</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
