<span class="line" data-line="8"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;development&quot;,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="9"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;parent_id&quot;: &quot;{main_branch_id}&quot;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="10"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">  },</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="11"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">  &quot;endpoints&quot;: [{</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="12"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;read_write&quot;,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="13"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;autoscaling_limit_min_cu&quot;: 0.25,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="14"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;autoscaling_limit_max_cu&quot;: 2,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="15"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">    &quot;suspend_timeout_seconds&quot;: 300</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="16"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">  }]</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="17"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)">}&#x27;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure><h3 id="compute-suspension-settings" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Compute suspension settings</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#compute-suspension-settings" aria-label="Link to Compute suspension settings"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><p>Control when development branch computes scale to zero:</p><ul>
<li><strong>Set to <code>0</code></strong>: Uses the default suspension timeout (300 seconds)</li>
<li><strong>Positive integer</strong> (for example, <code>600</code>): Custom timeout in seconds before scaling to zero</li>
<li><strong>Set to <code>-1</code></strong>: Disables suspension entirely (compute always on, higher costs)</li>
</ul><p>For development branches, a 5-minute timeout (300 seconds) balances cost efficiency with user experience.</p><p>This workflow prevents common issues like development data contaminating production databases, while giving users a safe space to experiment without risk.</p></div></li><li class="numbered-step relative mt-8! mb-0! flex w-full items-start gap-4 pl-0! before:flex before:size-7 before:items-center before:justify-center before:rounded-full before:bg-gray-new-20 before:text-center before:font-mono before:text-sm before:leading-snug before:font-medium before:tracking-tight before:text-white before:content-[counter(section)] before:[counter-increment:section] after:absolute after:top-8 after:-bottom-7 after:left-[.8125rem] after:w-px after:bg-gray-new-90 first:mt-0! last:after:bottom-0 dark:before:bg-gray-new-90 dark:before:text-black-pure dark:after:bg-gray-new-30 [&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal!"><div class="w-[calc(100%-100px)] flex-1 [&amp;&gt;*_*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:pt-0 md:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><h2 id="monitoring-and-billing" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Monitoring and billing</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#monitoring-and-billing" aria-label="Link to Monitoring and billing"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2><h3 id="track-usage-per-project" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Track usage per project</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#track-usage-per-project" aria-label="Link to Track usage per project"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><div class="prose-doc post-content prose dark:prose-invert xs:prose-code:break-words"><div class="admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#E2301D] dark:border-[#FF5645] [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-3 [&amp;_pre_code]:text-sm! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#E2301D] dark:text-[#FF5645]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="shrink-0"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8.005 11.999a.833.833 0 1 0 0-1.667.833.833 0 0 0 0 1.667"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" stroke-width="1.333" d="M8 8.667V6M6.782 2.707l-5.266 9.188A1.405 1.405 0 0 0 2.736 14h10.532a1.405 1.405 0 0 0 1.22-2.105L9.22 2.707a1.405 1.405 0 0 0-2.439 0Z"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">Deprecation notice: GET /consumption_history/account</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p>The <strong><a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/getconsumptionhistoryperaccount" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get account consumption metrics<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a></strong> endpoint (<code>GET /consumption_history/account</code>) is <strong>deprecated</strong>, with a planned sunset of <strong>June 1, 2026</strong>. Migrate to <strong><a class="" href="/docs/guides/consumption-metrics">Query consumption metrics</a></strong> for invoice-aligned project metrics, or to the <strong><a class="" href="/docs/guides/consumption-metrics-legacy#project-level-endpoint">legacy project metrics endpoint</a></strong> (<code>GET /consumption_history/projects</code>) if you need legacy metrics per project.</p></div></div></div><p>You can use the Neon API to retrieve consumption metrics for your organizations and projects using these endpoints:</p><div class="table-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/getconsumptionhistoryperaccount" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get account consumption metrics<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a></td><td>Aggregates all metrics from all projects in an account into a single cumulative number for each metric</td></tr><tr><td><a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/getconsumptionhistoryperproject" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get consumption metrics for each project<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a></td><td>Provides detailed metrics for each project in an account at a specified granularity level (hourly, daily, or monthly)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Available metrics:</p><ul>
<li><code>active_time_seconds</code>: Compute active time</li>
<li><code>compute_time_seconds</code>: CPU seconds consumed</li>
<li><code>written_data_bytes</code>: Data written to all branches</li>
<li><code>synthetic_storage_size_bytes</code>: Total storage used</li>
</ul><div class="admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#BE8A3C] dark:border-[#FFED9C] [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-3 [&amp;_pre_code]:text-sm! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#BE8A3C] dark:text-[#FFED9C]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="shrink-0"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M8 11.5a5 5 0 1 0 0-10 5 5 0 0 0 0 10Z"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M5 6.5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="m5.781 11 .282 3H10l.281-3"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-miterlimit="10" d="M7 15h2"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">tip</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p>On usage-based plans (Launch, Scale, Agent, Enterprise), you can also use the v2 endpoints, which return invoice-aligned metrics. The <a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/getconsumptionhistoryperprojectv2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">project metrics endpoint<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> (<code>GET /consumption_history/v2/projects</code>) returns billing-aligned totals per project. The <a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/getconsumptionhistoryperbranchv2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">branch metrics endpoint<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> (<code>GET /consumption_history/v2/branches</code>) breaks those metrics down by branch — useful for attributing usage to individual CI or development branches. See <a class="" href="/docs/guides/consumption-metrics">Query consumption metrics</a>.</p></div></div><p>For complete details on parameters, pagination, response formats, and metric definitions, see <a class="" href="/docs/guides/consumption-metrics">Query consumption metrics</a>.</p><h3 id="configure-consumption-limits" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Configure consumption limits</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#configure-consumption-limits" aria-label="Link to Configure consumption limits"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3><p>Set consumption limits per project to control costs. You can configure these limits during <a class="" href="#provisioning-projects">project creation</a> (as shown in the examples above) or update them later using the <a class="group inline" href="https://api-docs.neon.tech/reference/updateproject" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Update project<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> API:</p><figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">curl</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> --request</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> PATCH</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --url</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> https://console.neon.tech/api/v2/projects/{project_id}</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --header</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;Accept: application/json&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)">     --header</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &quot;Authorization: Bearer $NEON_API_KEY&quot;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> \</span></span>
